      ('Adom','Ohemaa Mercy','Gospel','A,E,D',1,9,'https://www.youtube.com/embed/JMq5bmYEGT4','A \u2192 E \u2192 D \u2192 A','Adom, adom, wo dom no so...',1),
      ('Onaapo','Bisa Kdei','Highlife','G,C,D,Em',2,9,'https://www.youtube.com/embed/tNZ3E8y5BCo','G \u2192 C \u2192 D \u2192 Em','Onaapo, me na me do wo...',1),
      ('Too Much','Kofi Kinaata','Hiplife','Am,F,G,C',2,9,'https://www.youtube.com/embed/H3Ys3rXs0eg','Am \u2192 F \u2192 G \u2192 C','Too much, too much, this thing too much...',1),
      ('Sore','KiDi','Afrobeats','Em,G,D,A',3,11,'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Zlx94hS0WnU','Em \u2192 G \u2192 D \u2192 A','Sore, sore, me do wo sore...',1),
      ('Dwom','Akwaboah','Highlife','Am,G,F,E',3,11,'https://www.youtube.com/embed/ccTBPyFKKpI','Am \u2192 G \u2192 F \u2192 E','Dwom, dwom, this dwom ye de...',1),
