      ('Blessings','Akwaboah','Highlife','C,G,Am,F',2,9,'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kz3W79b0Kmg','C \u2192 G \u2192 Am \u2192 F','Blessings, blessings, count your blessings...',1),
