      ('Down flat (Midi)','Ebo Taylor','Highlife','Am7,D7,Gmaj7,Cmaj7',3,14,'https://www.youtube.com/embed/U49E1he7RZc','Am7 \u2192 D7 \u2192 Gmaj7 \u2192 Cmaj7','Instrumental highlife groove...',1),
