2192 Premium Package. Full details in your dashboard.</p>' : "") + `</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:center;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #E2E6ED"><p style="font-family:'Courier Prime',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#94A3B8;margin:0">Studio Gabochie &mdash; Accra, Ghana</p></td></tr></table></body></html>`;
